                          91 --56: /*===========================================================================
                          92 --57:   Process a KDF according to E_KDF1/KDF2/KDF3 algorithm
                          93 --58:   E_KDF1/KDF2/KFD3 are defined in ISO 18033-2
                          94 --59:   E_KDF3 is defined in NIST SP800-56A
                          95 --60:   - p_kdf: pointer to KDF parameters
                          96 --61:   - returns 0 if OK
                          97 --62:     - in this case p_kdf->p_derived_key points to the derived key
                          98 --63:   - retruns a value different from 0 if NG
                          99 --64:   [PRIVATE]
