                         700 --255: * Function name: l_ECC_Pbkdf1
                         701 --256: * Description  : Process a KDF according to PBKDF1
                         702 --257: *                PBKDF1 is defined in PKCS5-v1
                         703 --258: *                - p_kdf: pointer to KDF parameters
                         704 --259: *                - returns 0 if OK
                         705 --260: *                - in this case p_kdf->p_derived_key points to the derived key
                         706 --261: *                - retruns a value different from 0 if NG
                         707 --262: * Arguments    : p_kdf  :[in/out]     :pointer to KDF parameters   
                         708 --263: * Return Value : ER_OK
                         709 --264: *                ER_L_ECC_INVALID_ARG
                         710 --265: *                ER_L_HASH_INVALID_ARG
                         711 --266: ***************************************************************************************/
